 "title": "100 V N-channel trench MOSFET in SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.2",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "A small-signal N-channel enhancement MOSFET in the three-lead SOT-23, made on a trench process. It blocks 100 V and carries 0.17 A at 25 °C ambient. On-resistance is at most 6 Ω with 10 V on the gate and 10 Ω at 4.5 V, and the threshold lies between 0.8 V and 2.8 V. Listed uses are load switching in portable equipment, DC/DC conversion, battery protection and power management.",
